.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# RESULTS.md and bench/out/ are NOT ignored - they are the deliverable.
# RESULTS.md is generated by bench/report.py, and bench/out/*.json is the
# provenance behind every figure in it. A results table with no committed
# source is an assertion.

# archive/prometheus-data.tgz IS committed - 322KB of time-series, and the only
# way a clone can replay the actual runs rather than an empty dashboard.
#
# Grafana's own state is not: 20MB of bundled plugin images plus grafana.db,
# which holds the admin credential hash. It is also redundant - dashboards and
# the datasource are provisioned from observability/grafana/, so a fresh Grafana
# comes up identical.
archive/grafana-data.tgz
archive/prom-data/
archive/grafana-data/

# local operational tooling, not part of the deliverable
Makefile.up
